<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-10-12T18:04:58.975Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 18:04:58 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Philippine Coast Guard, Navy and Marine Corps have recently repelled five unauthorized Vietnam-flagged fishing vessels near Kota Island in the West Philippine Sea and confronted the Chinese research vessel Tan Suo Yi Hao when it entered the area. The PCG continues to block Chinese Coast Guard water-cannon attacks on its ships conducting medical evacuations at Ayungin Shoal and in the Luzon Strait. An upgraded PCG station was opened on Pag-asa Island, strengthening the Philippines' presence on the disputed atoll. 176 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxOaXFxYXNELTRqeU1fUE45MW5uc2pXWGZ0dTRFWXJfRTlMRXBEUEk3X3RiVXJieVVBWG54b3VVOVVhRF9lWnNfS090VDAtbElUT3B3TmVjc0NjM3FaQWszUVk0cHZCNEJKYnpjZFVnZkwyRFMxUXlvZGoxVl9ock5YN2V4VzlSUy1CUjVUak5fV1lmT1pOcGRmcGU2MGE2WUhlLThkRmlwbkVsVWZINWc4WTZQTHhBRHdRRmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTFBGWnh2S2tpUU5IZUpqUVVhQkp5eWVReEYwWjhqMDZYQUVaZ1BVVFZBX1RGSjdCTjVmN1N1RmpoWV9zMnAwUXVpR1lHYWl6b3BwajYtV25LY3MzbGhPaEl1cy1DbXlpRVJlOTE0RUFRTXZxN1E4c2hBWFp3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Taipei Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Inquirer.net&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Wired Gov&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;GMA Network&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxQdm1STTVzR1hFaFZpZHhHN2tEVjNKRUt0UTdfVnhRNFMzR0JKalE0QUtFcUNUT3pFQ3RaUlpUNUN1VlpseWJWcy05X0JxbV9pYzI4cVlfcGhTOGJfNktPV3lBLTMybzRQcXJ2d253RHJHNVlpRmtBeHNERzZWdmc1UzZYbUx3ZExoOE5XX2k5UElYNTNfUmtoamc1QWM?oc=5&quot;&gt;The China-Global South Project&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.